{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object visible, approach and take it, then sort it in order to move to location A or B.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocationA    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocationB    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    /> <SubTree ID = SortObject    />\"",
